# MQ Launcher Portable Mode Indicator
#
# When this file is present alongside mq.exe, MQ runs in isolated portable mode.
# All data (instances, configs, cache, accounts) will be stored in a local directory
# next to the executable instead of %LOCALAPPDATA%\MQ and %APPDATA%\MQ.
#
# To revert to standard system-installed mode, delete or rename this file.
